depart and arrive times, stops, duration, and a price for Economy, Premium Economy, and Business Class. A cabin's price is its cheapest fare. Opening the Economy price lists its fares: Basic on some routes, then Standard, Flex, Comfort, and Latitude. Prices are per person and include taxes;
